{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_WHATS_IN_THE_DEMO.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two playable characters</strong>, each with a unique pool of cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One act of content </strong>ending in a boss fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many <strong>enemies, encounters, and upgrades</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...with even more in the full game!<br><br>The demo does not contain these features from the full game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable difficulty levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Localization to non-English languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_TILE_BASED_MANA_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play cards by <strong>positioning magic sigils</strong> on the crescent moon. There's <strong>no limit to how many cards you can play,</strong> as long as you have the space! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_SIMPLE_PLACEMENT_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_BUILD_YOUR_DECK_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo has <strong>two playable characters </strong>and <strong>over a hundred cards </strong>to choose from, allowing for countless possible decks and a variety of strategies and play styles. The full game will have even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_CARDS_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_POSITIONING_MATTERS_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Position your sigils strategically</strong> and get massive bonuses for adjacency, overlap, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_COMBO_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_EVERY_TURN_IS_UNIQUE_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Some sigils</strong> <strong>persist on your board</strong> between turns or have <strong>ongoing effects. </strong>Certain enemies will even cast their own <strong>hostile sigils</strong> onto your board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_PLACEMENT_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_MODIFY_YOUR_CARDS_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade your cards</strong> and inscribe them<strong> </strong>with <strong>runes of power</strong>. Spread the benefits over your entire deck, or put everything into one or two overpowered cards.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_UPGRADE_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_JOURNEY_ACROSS_THE_STARS_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel across the fallen realms and experience visions from beyond. </strong>Choose between mysterious boons, powerful upgrades, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_LIGHTS_1.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590810?t=1745076410","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/f2a44259ae973b120a697ed101dbf5a57c18997e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745076410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/b67bbc014a6d23f9d5b00d69f797a4dc610cb8f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745076410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/b67bbc014a6d23f9d5b00d69f797a4dc610cb8f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745076410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590810/extras/GIF_WHATS_IN_THE_DEMO.gif?t=1745076410\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two playable characters</strong>, each with a unique pool of cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One act of content </strong>ending in a boss fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many <strong>enemies, encounters, and upgrades</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...with even more in the full game!<br><br>The demo does not contain these features from the full game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable difficulty levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Locali